Package: sanpo
Title: Patient Journeys from Claims and Medical Databases
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person(given  = "Yoichi",
           family = "Masui",
           email  = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com",
           role   = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Patient journeys (sanpo, 'a walk') from claims and medical
    databases, with Japanese data in mind. Episode data are turned into one
    journey object (the sequence of states per patient, a states dictionary
    and the parameters used), from which static 'ggplot2' Sankey diagrams,
    sunbursts, icicles and pathway tables are drawn with the same node
    order and the same colours. Empty states are kept as empty nodes.
URL: https://github.com/ichirio/sanpo
